[[Dante Vale]] used the spell in the [[Temple of Thor]] to place [[Tersly]] in a bubble in order to get him out of harm's way whilst fighting [[Fenris]]. He floated over to [[Sophie Casterwill]] who popped the bubble and helped him up. {{source|Two Powers Become One}}

Sophie used the spell to remove and destroy traps left by [[Klaus]] in a cabinet in his [[Klaus' bookshop|lab]]. She later used it to block a stairway with a bookcase, bolstered by Dante's [[Stopglue]] power. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}

In the [[Mausoleum of Sir Lancelot]], Sophie used the spell to trap [[Impet]] in a bubble before [[Sabriel]] slammed it into a [[Suit]]. {{source|Memory Lane}}

[[Zhalia Moon]] used the spell to take the [[Ring]] of [[Behemoth]] from [[Hippolyta]]. {{source|Ladies' Choice}}

After her parachute was compromised by attacks from [[Wilder]]'s [[Suits]], Sophie used Bubblelift to stop herself from falling. The bubble was hit by another attack however, leaving her to cling to a branch of a tree. {{source|Doorway to Huntik}}

[[Lok Lambert]] used the spell to attach [[Dendras]]' dragons to [[Incubane]] whilst fighting [[Wilder]] on [[Avalon]]. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}} 

Sophie used the spell to land a bin on top of a [[Silent Soldier]] in [[Rotterdam, Netherlands]]. {{source|Den vs Harrison}}

Lok used it in conjunction with Dendras again in [[Medusa's Cave]] to neutralize [[Vulcana]] whilst ambushing [[Kiel]]. {{source|Zhalia's Mission}}

[[Sophie Casterwill]] used Bubblelift to create a water balloon to throw at [[Den Fears]] whilst attempting to tutor him. He later attempted to do the same but she caught him. {{Source|Lok's Leadership}}

[[Dante Vale]] used the spell to remove the [[Amulet]] of [[Legion]] from around [[Rassimov]]'s neck and kick it towards [[Lok]] who destroyed it using the [[Willblade]]. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}

[[Scarlet Byrne]] used a red version of the spell on herself so she could safely land as she jumped off a [[Scramjet]] during the final battle at the [[Blood Spiral Base]]. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}}

{{Clear}}

